## 🔮 Roadmap & Future Improvements

* [ ] Add **Beam Search Decoding** for improved inference generation quality.
* [ ] Transition from word-level spaCy to **Byte-Pair Encoding (BPE)** tokenization (e.g., SentencePiece).
* [ ] Implement **Corpus-level BLEU** scoring in addition to sentence-level evaluations.
* [ ] Add **TensorBoard / Weights & Biases** monitoring dashboard integration.
* [ ] Scale architecture up to larger NMT benchmarks (WMT14).

